    {
      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "Use of Proceeds We estimate that the net proceeds from the sale of the Notes, after deducting the underwriters\u2019 discounts and estimated offering expenses, will be approximately $ . We intend to use the net proceeds from the sale of the Notes to refinance certain existing indebtedness, including to repay at maturity our 2027 Notes, with any remaining net proceeds to be used for general corporate and working capital purposes, which may include repayment of borrowings under our commercial paper program. Pending such use, we may use some or all of the net proceeds for general corporate and working capital purposes. We have broad discretion in the use of such proceeds. See \u201c Use of Proceeds .\u201d Change of Control Upon the occurrence of a Change of Control Triggering Event with respect to a series of Notes, unless we have exercised our right to redeem the Notes of such series in accordance with ",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Risk Factors",
      "excerpt": "Risk Factors An investment in the Notes involves risks. Prospective investors should carefully consider the information set forth herein under \u201c Risk Factors \u201d and in Part\u00a01, Item\u00a01A. \u201cRisk Factors\u201d of our Annual Report on Form\u00a010 -K for the year ended December\u00a031, 2025 (the \u201c2025 Annual Report\u201d), as well as in our other periodic reports filed with the SEC from time to time and incorporated by reference herein. Governing Law The Notes will be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of New\u00a0York. S-3 Table of Contents RISK FACTORS You should carefully consider the following risks and the risks described in the accompanying prospectus and in the documents incorporated by reference herein and therein, including our 2025 Annual Report and the documents we file with the SEC after the date of this prospectus supplement that are deemed incorporated by reference in this",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
